 <li class="c-secondaryMenu__item"> <a href="blog/">Blog</a> </li> <li class="c-secondaryMenu__item"> <a href="contact/">Contact</a> </li> <li class="c-secondaryMenu__item -enquireNow"> <a onclick="toggleContactGuestManagerPopup('enquire');" href="javascript:;">Enquire</a> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="c-secondaryMenu__list__items media--dropMenu fadeIn-dur400">  <span class="mbl-projBack"><svg class="c-backButton__arrow" width="16" height="13" viewBox="0 0 16 13" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"> <path d="M16 6.5001C16 6.86441 15.7264 7.16549 15.3714 7.21314L15.2727 7.21971L2.48824 7.21913L7.1069 11.7705C7.39152 12.0509 7.39252 12.5065 7.10911 12.7881C6.85147 13.0442 6.44748 13.0682 6.16232 12.8598L6.08059 12.7903L0.213929 7.01042C0.17641 6.97345 0.143822 6.93345 0.116165 6.8912C0.108353 6.87848 0.100402 6.86548 0.0928628 6.85221C0.0859286 6.84083 0.079662 6.82902 0.0737512 6.81708C0.065541 6.7997 0.0575187 6.78175 0.0502355 6.76343C0.0443179 6.74931 0.0393769 6.73557 0.0348699 6.72173C0.0295112 6.70456 0.0243051 6.68626 0.0198276 6.66769C0.0164983 6.65472 0.0138614 6.64224 0.0115621 6.62971C0.0083272 6.61106 0.00557489 6.59177 0.00361032 6.57225C0.00191469 6.55736 0.000893307 6.54261 0.000329686 6.52784C0.000183774 6.51889 6.69134e-07 6.50951 6.69546e-07 6.5001L0.000364974 6.47222C0.000921921 6.4581 0.00189658 6.44399 0.00329085 6.42991L6.69546e-07 6.5001C6.71531e-07 6.45468 0.0042512 6.41026 0.0123813 6.36718C0.0142667 6.35689 0.0165135 6.34633 0.0190007 6.33581C0.0241668 6.31415 0.0301368 6.29329 0.0370118 6.27284C0.0403859 6.26268 0.044316 6.25182 0.0485179 6.24104C0.0570161 6.21939 0.0662543 6.19875 0.0764167 6.17864C0.0811374 6.16919 0.0864246 6.15929 0.0919616 6.14949C0.10105 6.13351 0.110413 6.11832 0.120313 6.10352C0.127299 6.09304 0.135033 6.08213 0.143111 6.0714L0.149405 6.0631C0.168999 6.03778 0.190255 6.01377 0.213013 5.99125L0.213886 5.99059L6.08055 0.209716C6.36516 -0.0707267 6.82564 -0.0697834 7.10907 0.211823C7.36673 0.467829 7.38937 0.867657 7.17753 1.14894L7.10694 1.2295L2.49018 5.77991L15.2727 5.78049C15.6744 5.78049 16 6.10267 16 6.5001Z" fill="#6F7073"></path> </svg>Back</span> <p class="mbl-mediaTitle">Media Room</p>  <ul class="media-ddl "> <li class="c-secondaryMenu__item"><a href="awards/">Awards</a></li> <li class="c-secondaryMenu__item"><a href="media-coverage/">Media Coverage</a></li> <li class="c-secondaryMenu__item"><a href="press-releases/">Press Releases</a></li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <div id="circle"></div></div>  <div id="aboutUs" data-page="aboutUs">  <main>  <section class="mainHeading" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <h1 class="mainHeading__title introAnimElement transitionDelay80"> Constantly Committed </h1> <div class="button__wrapper introAnimElement transitionDelay120"> <a href="our-belief/" class="ourBelief__btn primary__btn c-button --rounded transitionDelay160"> <span>Our Belief</span> </a> <a href="javascript:;" data-open="v-modal" id="moreBlogs" class="watchBrandFilm__btn primary__btn c-button --rounded transitionDelay160"> <img postload-image src="assets/common/vectors/icon-play.svg" alt="Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate"> <span>Watch Brand Film</span> </a> </div> </section>  <section class="aboutUs__banner"> <ul class="innerBanner"> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"> <div class="video-section rndCorner"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/topBanner/01.png" class="bannerImage" alt="Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate"> <figcaption> <a href="javascript:;" class="v-play-ico open-modal" data-open="v-modal"> <img postload-image src="assets/common/vectors/icon-video-play.svg" alt="Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate"> </a> </figcaption> </div> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"> <div class="rndCorner"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/topBanner/02.png" class="bannerImage" alt="Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate"> </div> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"> <div class="rndCorner"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/topBanner/03.png" class="bannerImage" alt="Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate"> </div> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"> <div class="rndCorner"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/topBanner/04.png" class="bannerImage" alt="Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate"> </div> </li> </ul> </section>    <section class="stroke__title"> <div class="marquee"> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-philosohpy.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-philosohpy.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-philosohpy.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-philosohpy.svg" alt=""> </span> </div> </section>  <section class="aboutUs"> <div class="aboutUs__section"> <div class="aboutUs__title"> <div class="home__dots"> <div class="home__dot bgc-purple" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"></div> <div class="home__dot bgc-magicPotion" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"></div> <div class="home__dot bgc-yellow" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"></div> <div class="home__dot bgc-persianGreen" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateBannerCardIn"></div> </div> </div> <div class="aboutUs__desc" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <p class="introAnimElement"> As we foray into a new realm of limitless opportunities in technology and engineering, we bring a re-energised and rejuvenated identity. Ingrained in this new identity are values strengthened over the last 160+ years. <br><br> The ‘Rings of Refresh’ philosophy represents the core tenets of who we are. We are mindful of our duty to society. We are passionate about excellence. We exemplify hope and trust. We believe in the power of continuous innovation. <br><br> Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate is now ISO 9001:2015, ISO 14001:2015 & ISO 45001:2018 certified. These certifications help strengthen our commitment to quality and services, environmental safety, and occupational health and safety standards; and reinstate our consumers’ trust in the quality of homes provided by us. </p> <p class="introAnimElement transitionDelay120"> <a href="assets/pdf/iso-cetificate/ISO_Certificate.pdf" class="readMore_btn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"> View certificate <img src="assets/common/vectors/arrow_right.svg" alt="icon"> </a> </p>  </div> </div> </section>    <section class="stroke__title"> <div class="marquee"> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-work.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-work.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-work.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-work.svg" alt=""> </span> </div> </section>  <section class="aboutUs"> <div class="aboutUs__section"> <div class="aboutUs__title"> <h2 class="anim-title" observer-animation="title">Committed to <br class="is-below-768" />building heritage </h2> </div> <div class="aboutUs__desc" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <p class="introAnimElement"> With a significant part to play in the 160+ year journey of the Shapoorji Pallonji Group, we’ve built our reputation by building some of India’s most iconic structures that have stood the test of time. <br><br> With thoughtful design, solid construction, and the latest in engineering, we build structures that silently scream strength and stability, and last generations. </p> <p class="introAnimElement transitionDelay120"> <a href="history/" class="readMore_btn"> Explore our work over the last 160+ years <img src="assets/common/vectors/arrow_right.svg" alt="icon"> </a> </p> </div> </div> </section>    <section class="stroke__title"> <div class="marquee"> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-homes.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-homes.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-homes.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/our-homes.svg" alt=""> </span> </div> </section>  <section class="aboutUs"> <div class="aboutUs__section"> <div class="aboutUs__title txt-magicPotion"> <h2 class="anim-title" observer-animation="title">A home always is. <br class="is-below-768">There’s beauty <br class="is-desktop"> in that. </h2> </div> <div class="aboutUs__desc" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <p class="introAnimElement"> With a commitment to delivering world-class living spaces to the citizens, we build residential spaces across the country. <br><br> Because home is what you come back to every day, and we ensure you look forward to it every time. </p> <p class="introAnimElement transitionDelay120"> <a href="javascript:;" class="readMore_btn" id="exploreHomes"> Explore our homes <img src="assets/common/vectors/arrow_right.svg" alt="icon"> </a> </p> </div> </div> </section>    <section class="stroke__title"> <div class="marquee"> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/sp-infocity.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/sp-infocity.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/sp-infocity.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/sp-infocity.svg" alt=""> </span> </div> </section>  <section class="aboutUs"> <div class="aboutUs__section"> <div class="aboutUs__title txt-spanishYellow"> <h2 class="anim-title" observer-animation="title"> A beautiful office makes work feel like play </h2> </div> <div class="aboutUs__desc" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <p class="introAnimElement"> Through SP Infocity, we have created a brand for commercial workspaces that are comfortable, state-of-the-art, and certified green. <br><br> With the service and support provided by the SP Group of companies, we undertake end-to-end execution of hubs that serve as headquarters for top businesses and brands. </p> <p class="introAnimElement transitionDelay120"> <a href="https://shapoorjirealestate.com/commercial/sp-infocity-pune/" class="readMore_btn" id="exploreSPInfocity"> Explore SP Infocity <img src="assets/common/vectors/arrow_right.svg" alt="icon"> </a> </p> </div> </div> </section>    <section class="stroke__title"> <div class="marquee"> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/redevelopment-projects.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/redevelopment-projects.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/redevelopment-projects.svg" alt=""> </span> <span> <img src="./assets/common/vectors/about-svg/redevelopment-projects.svg" alt=""> </span> </div> </section>  <section class="aboutUs"> <div class="aboutUs__section"> <div class="aboutUs__title txt-persianGreen"> <h2 class="anim-title" observer-animation="title"> Homes that <br class="is-desktop"> protect, nurture <br class="is-desktop"> and cherish </h2> </div> <div class="aboutUs__desc" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <p class="introAnimElement"> In collaboration with Dilip Thacker, Shapoorji Pallonji established SD Corp - a venture that specialises in redevelopment. <br><br> SD Corp reimagines ordinary settlements and converts them into homes that offer a renewed sense of safety, comfort and assurance to thousands of people. </p> <p class="introAnimElement transitionDelay120">  </p> </div> </div> </section>  <section class="ourInitiatives__banner"> <div class="fullwidthBanner"> <img postload-image src="assets/common/images/empty.png" desktop-src="assets/pages/about-us/ourInitiatives-banner-d.png" mobile-src="assets/pages/about-us/ourInitiatives-banner-m.png" class="bannerImage" alt="Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate"> <div class="overlayCard" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <h2 class="overlayCard__title introAnimElement">Committed to <br> Giving Back</h2> <p class="overlayCard__desc introAnimElement transitionDelay80 is-desktop"> Charitable initiatives that empower our <br class="is-desktop"> communities and help us gain perspective <br class="is-desktop"> on social issues. </p> <p class="introAnimElement transitionDelay160"> <a href="csr/" class="readMore_btn --rounded-brd"> Explore our initiatives <img src="assets/common/vectors/arrow_right.svg" alt="icon"> </a> </p> </div> </div> </section>  <section id="management" class="management -centerContent"> <div class="management__title" observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <h2 class="introAnimElement transitionDelay80"> Committed to <span class="txt-magicPotion">Growth</span> </h2> </div>  <div class="management__contain is-desk"> <div class="cg-col-3"> <ul> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="venkatesh-gopalkrishnan"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/VenkateshGopalkrishnan.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Venkatesh Gopalakrishnan"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Venkatesh Gopalakrishnan</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Director, Group Promoter's Office & Managing Director, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate </p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> </ul> </div> <div class="cg-col-3"> <ul> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="sumit-sapru"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/sumitSapru.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Sumit Sapru"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Sumit Sapru</h3> <p class="heads__desc">CEO, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="sriram-mahadevan"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/sriram.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Sriram Mahadevan"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Sriram Mahadevan</h3> <p class="heads__desc">CEO, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate & Managing Director, Joyville Shapoorji Housing</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="saureenDesai"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/SaureenDesai.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Saureen Desai"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Saureen Desai</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Chief Financial Officer, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="nirav-dalal"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/nirav.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Nirav Dalal"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Nirav Dalal</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Chief Investment & Business Development Officer, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li>  </ul> </div> <div class="cg-col-3"> <ul>  <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="gourav-bhutani"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/GouravBhutani.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Gourav Bhutani"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Gourav Bhutani</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Executive Vice President - Investments and Corporate Planning & Business Head, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE)</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="mohan-Jacob"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/mohan.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Mohan Jacob"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Mohan Jacob</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Executive Vice President - Design, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li>   </ul> </div> <div class="cg-col-3"> <ul> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="sanjay-shenoy"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/sanjay.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Sanjay Shenoy"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Sanjay Shenoy</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Executive Vice President - Human Resources, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate </p> </figcaption> </figure> </li>  <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="viralThakker"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/ViralThakkar.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Viral Thakker"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Viral Thakker</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Senior Vice President – Commercial, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li>   <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introA