 Director, Joyville Shapoorji Housing</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="saureenDesai"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/SaureenDesai.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Saureen Desai"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Saureen Desai</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Chief Financial Officer, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="nirav-dalal"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/nirav.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Nirav Dalal"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Nirav Dalal</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Chief Investment & Business Development Officer, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li>     <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="gourav-bhutani"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/GouravBhutani.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Gourav Bhutani"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Gourav Bhutani</h3> <p class="heads__desc">Executive Vice President - Investments and Corporate Planning & Business Head, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE)</p> </figcaption> </figure> </li> <li observer-animation="cssClass" observer-animation-classes="animateIn"> <figure class="management__card introAnimElement transitionDelay120 js-openMemberModal" data-member-id="mohan-Jacob"> <img postload-image src="assets/pages/about-us/management/mohan.webp" class="heads__Image" alt="Mr. Mohan Jacob"> <figcaption> <h3 class="heads__name">Mr. Mohan Jacob</h3> <p class="heads