                //     description: "Kekoo Colah is the Executive Director of Shapoorji Pallonji and Company Private Limited and mentors the Real Estate businesses of the Group. Prior to joining the SP Group, he was the Managing Director of Rutley Capital Partners India, the real estate private equity arm of Knight Frank, UK, one of the world's leading property consultancy firms. Before this, he was the Executive Director at Knight Frank India, where he headed Operations and was part of the core management team from the inception of Knight Frank's Indian operations in 1995.<br><br>He has served a successful tenure of over 14 years with Ingersoll - Rand(India) Ltd.and, prior to that, 3 years with Larsen & Toubro Ltd.<br><br>Kekoo is a Bachelor of Technology(Mechanical Engineering) from the Indian Institute of Technology, Bombay and a Master of Science(Management Science) from the Imperial College of Science & Technology, London.He has over 30 years of work experience in Sales, Marketing, Finance, Corporate Planning, Project Evaluation and Implementation.",
