                    description: "Mr. Mohan Jacob is the Executive Vice President of Design at Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate Division. He has nearly three decades of professional experience in residential, hospitality, commercial, industrial, institutional, and recreational segments at national and international levels. At Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate, he heads the division's master planning, urban design, architecture, interior design, and landscape functions.<br><br>Mohan was an Executive Director at Lanco in Hyderabad before joining Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate. He has also worked for Bechtel as a Chief Architect and Program Manager in Amby Valley and Sahara Lake City.<br><br>Mohan holds a Bachelor’s degree in Architecture from the University of Pune. He has also completed an advanced programme in Leadership Strategy at the Indian Institute of Management, Lucknow. He is also a Certified Quality Auditor from the Indian Institute of Quality Management, Jaipur.",
                },

                "sanjay-shenoy": {
                    name: "Mr. Sanjay Shenoy",
                    image: "assets/pages/about-us/management/sanjay.webp",
