                    description: "Mr. Sanjay Shenoy is the Executive Vice President of Human Resources at Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE). He is a strategic thinker and is instrumental in nurturing a positive people culture to support the company’s vision.<br><br>Sanjay joined SPRE in 2014 and has led various people initiatives on employee experience, talent management, creating high-performance teams, and enhancing collaborations across geographically dispersed business regions.<br><br>Sanjay has nearly three decades of experience in various aspects of human resource management, leading initiatives like organisational restructuring, organisational effectiveness, talent management, performance management, and culture building. He has also implemented process enhancements across different industries, including financial services, ITES, and real estate.<br/><br/>Before joining SPRE, Sanjay served as the Head of Human Resources at Tata Housing Development Co. Ltd. He completed his MBA at the Cochin University of Science and Technology.",
                },
                "venkatesh-gopalkrishnan": {
                    name: "Mr. Venkatesh Gopalakrishnan",
