                    designation: "Director, Group Promoter’s Office, MD - Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE)",
                    description: "Mr. Venkatesh Gopalakrishnan (Venky) has nearly three decades of versatile work experience in real estate, financial services, and infrastructure.<br/><br/> As Director of the Group Promoter’s Office, Venky is responsible for executing the promoter’s vision across the Group. On behalf of the promoter family, he manages critical stakeholder relationships, including those with banks, regulators, joint venture partners, and investors.<br/><br/> Since 2010, Mr. Venkatesh Gopalakrishnan has led the growth of the real estate business of the SP Group (SPRE) and took over as its CEO in 2016. Venky also incubated and grew India’s fastest-growing middle-income housing brand, Joyville Shapoorji Housing. He has grown and nurtured partnerships with development partners, marquee global investors, and financial institutions. Today, SPRE has grown into one of India's leading real estate developers.<br/><br/> Before joining SPRE, he was the Managing Director and Country Head of Westport Capital Partners, Mumbai. He has also held leadership positions with organisations like Ernst & Young, Enron India Pvt. Ltd., Crisil Advisory Services, and the Industrial Development Bank of India.<br/><br/> Venky has completed his Bachelor of Engineering in Mechanical from the Government College of Engineering, Pune, and his MBA from the Symbiosis Institute, Pune.<br/><br/> Venky loves to travel with his family and enjoys music and cooking.",
                },
                // "kv-shreenivas": {
                //     name: "K V Shreenivas",
