                //     description: "Vijay is the Chief Operations Officer of the Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate division. He has over 25 years of business development and project management experience in the Indian Real Estate and construction sector.<br><br>With a Bachelor's degree in Civil Engineering from Andhra University and a Master's Diploma in Construction Management from the National Institute of Construction Management and Research, Vijay has also been a part of the Executive Leadership Development Programme conducted by the University of Denver, Colorado.<br><br>Prior to joining Shapoorji Pallonji, Vijay was the Chief Operating Officer overseeing projects for the entire Ashok Piramal Group (APG) and Chief Executive Officer for Good Time Real Estate Development Limited (a subsidiary of APG ). He oversaw the entire Operations, Design, Approvals, Engineering, Procurement, Construction, Quality, Safety and Handover of residential, commercial, shopping and mixed development Projects in high-end, super premium, premium, luxury and affordable segments across the top cities in India. Throughout his career, Vijay has played a leading role in some of the major Real Estate companies in India and the middle-east like Tata Housing, Oberoi Realty, ETA-ASCON, L&T Oman and L&T India.",
                // },
                "sriram-mahadevan": {
                    name: "Mr. Sriram Mahadevan",
                    image: "assets/pages/about-us/management/sriram.webp",
                    designation: "CEO, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate and Managing Director, Joyville Shapoorji Housing",
                    description: "Mr Sriram Mahadevan is the CEO of Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE) & the Managing Director of Joyville Shapoorji Housing Pvt. Ltd. He has spearheaded the aspirational home platform of Shapoorji Pallonji under the brand name Joyville. He is responsible for strategically scaling the business by providing long-term direction to the company’s business and endeavouring to help the organisation scale and grow.<br/><br/> Under his leadership, Joyville forayed into the northern, eastern, and western regions. Sriram brings close to three decades of rich experience in the real estate industry, FMCG, banking, retail, and telecom, with proven expertise in leading successful startups across these sectors. His expertise is in growing a startup into a successful business. <br/><br/> Sriram joined Joyville in 2017 as Business Head and has been instrumental in the company’s growth since then. Before joining Joyville, he was the Business Head at Happinest, Mahindra Lifespaces, with full P&L responsibility. He also held senior management positions with Uninor, Tata Docomo, Reliance Retail, Coca-Cola India, Shaw Wallace & Company Limited, and SREI International Finance Limited. <br/><br/> Sriram is a Chartered Accountant from the Institute of Chartered Accountants of India and a Cost Accountant from the Institute of Cost and Work Accountants of India. He has pursued a B. Com. (Hons.) in Advanced Accounting from the University of Calcutta. <br/><br/> Sriram is a fitness enthusiast. He loves biking tours and exploring the countryside in India and abroad. He appreciates being surrounded by nature and enjoys adventure trips.",
                },
                "vijay-chaudhary": {
