                    description: "Mr. Vijay Chaudhary is the Executive Vice President of Quality Assurance/Quality Control and IT Systems at Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE). He monitors each part of the project management process to ensure quality standards. Vijay has over three decades of diverse domestic and international work experience across industries including real estate, construction, and hospitality.<br><br>Vijay joined the Shapoorji Pallonji Group in 2012 as the Vice President of Hospitality and Healthcare in the Engineering and Construction division. He moved into the real estate business in 2017 and has successfully led the initiative of setting up a dedicated QA/QC department. Vijay and his team have also developed the company’s quality procedures, standards, and specifications. He has also been instrumental in the creation of robust processes across departments. The IT systems team, which designs, manages, and monitors the usage of technology at SPRE, also reports to Vijay.<br><br>Vijay worked with Chalet Hotels Limited (a K Raheja Corp. company) as the Associate Vice President of Pre-Construction and MIS before joining Shapoorji Pallonji Group. He has vast experience in delivering large construction projects across IT/ITES, hotels, hospitals, commercial, and residential buildings. He is an Engineer and completed his B.E. Civil degree in 1988 from M.B.M. Engineering College, Jodhpur.",
                },
