                    description: "Mr. Nirav Dalal is Business Head and Chief Investment Officer at Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE). His responsibilities include land and project acquisition, redevelopment projects, fundraising, and investments. With P&L responsibility, Nirav has led business operations and implemented business strategies that help SPRE grow and be profitable.<br><br>He has nearly three decades of experience in strategy and corporate planning, business development, funding, business acquisitions, M&A, corporate financial services, accounts and finance, forex, taxation, assurance, management services, and systems development in the real estate, retail, manufacturing, IT software and hardware, and service industries.<br><br>Before joining SPRE, he headed Strategy and Corporate Planning at Tata Housing Development Co. Ltd., where he was responsible for strategy, business development and project acquisition, monetisation, top-bottom-line monitoring, project progress and profitability review, private equity funding, and innovation.<br/><br/> His previous roles include CFO at Lokhandwala Infrastructure & Kobian Electronics India and Senior Partner at A.H. Dalal & Co./B.V. Dalal & Co., a CA firm. He has co-authored a book on Mandatory Accounting Standards and contributed to the Bombay Chartered Accountants' Journal with various articles on Information Technology.<br/><br/>He is a Chartered Accountant (CA) with an MBA in Finance from NMIMS and a CISA by qualification.",
                },
                "gourav-bhutani": {
                    name: "Mr. Gourav Bhutani",
