                    designation: "Executive Vice President - Investments and Corporate Planning & Business Head, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE)",
                    description: "Mr. Gourav Bhutani is the Executive Vice President – Investments & Corporate Planning and also serves as the Business Head for designated projects in Gurugram and Pune. Gourav has nearly two decades of diverse work experience across industries, mainly Real Estate and Banking. Gourav has led different aspects of Real estate development, including land acquisition, fundraising, investor relations, asset management and business expansion.<br><br>Gourav joined Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate in 2016 and has been instrumental in setting up and expanding Joyville Shapoorji Housing Private Limited - a residential platform sponsored by Shapoorji Pallonji and funded by SP, IFC, ADB and ACTIS. He is responsible for managing investments, land acquisition, fundraising and corporate planning for Joyville Shapoorji Housing. As a Business Head, he is also responsible for the P&L of the projects in his portfolio. He is a graduate in Management from IIM-Lucknow (2004) and a Bachelor in Electronics and Communications Engineering (2001).",
                },
                "suraj_kulkarni": {
                    name: "Mr. Suraj Kulkarni",
                     image: "assets/pages/about-us/management/mr-suraj-kulkarni.webp",
                    designation: "Chief Operating Officer, Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate (SPRE)",
                    description: "Mr. Suraj Kulkarni is responsible for overseeing the end-to-end operations of the projects of the company. Suraj plays a pivotal role in streamlining execution across projects, driving operational efficiency and ensuring alignment with SPRE’s strategic objectives.<br><br>With over 3 decades extensive experience in the real estate and infrastructure sectors, Suraj has successfully led cross-functional teams and managed diverse portfolios spanning business development, project evaluation, construction management, development management, fundraising and complex regulatory approvals.<br><br>Prior to SPRE, Suraj held senior leadership roles at several reputed organizations. He served as Head - Business Development at Tata Realty & Infrastructure Limited, where he led investment and development strategy. He also headed Business Development at Peninsula Land Limited and L&T Realty, driving large-scale urban developments. Earlier, Suraj was part of the core team at GVK responsible for the construction and development of Terminal 2 at Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj International Airport (CSMIA), Mumbai - a marquee project in India’s infrastructure landscape.<br><br>Suraj holds a Bachelor’s degree in Engineering and a Master’s in Management Studies (M.M.S.) with dual specializations in Finance and Marketing. He has also completed an Advanced Business Management Program from the University of Chicago Booth School of Business, adding global perspective and strategic depth to his leadership approach.",
