                    description: "Mr. Saureen Desai is the Chief Financial Officer of Shapoorji Pallonji Real Estate and has nearly two decades of experience as a Business and Financial Analyst across industries. As CFO of SPRE, Saureen leads the complex operations of the real estate investment vehicles in addition to managing treasury, raising and managing funds, maintaining historical books and records, reporting to investors, and ensuring compliance with laws and regulations.<br><br>Before his current assignment as CFO, Saureen was the Vice President of Business Development at SPRE and successfully led project financing and structured multiple deals, including the setting up of the Joyville Shapoorji platform with three leading stream investors, viz., Actis, the Asian Development Bank, and the International Finance Corporation. He has been with the Shapoorji Pallonji Group since 2010.<br><br>Saureen holds a Post Graduate degree in Commerce from the University of Mumbai and a Master's degree in Business Administration from the University of Illinois at Chicago.",
